---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
const contactEmail = site.email || '[TODO: email@gpmm.site]';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How GPMM collects, uses and protects your personal data, in line with the GDPR / AVG."
  updated="2 November 2026"
>
  <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    This website is operated by {site.name} ("we", "us"), based in {site.location}.
    We are the controller of the personal data you share with us.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Company: {site.name}</li>
    <li>KvK (Chamber of Commerce): {site.legal.kvk}</li>
    <li>BTW (VAT): {site.legal.btw}</li>
    <li>Email: {contactEmail}</li>
    <li>WhatsApp: {site.whatsapp.display}</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. What data we collect</h2>
  <p>When you submit the funnel audit or contact form, we collect the information you provide:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Name and email address</li>
    <li>Company name and website (optional)</li>
    <li>Phone number (optional)</li>
    <li>Your monthly marketing budget and services of interest</li>
    <li>Any message you send us</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We also collect limited technical data (such as cookies) — see our <a href="/legal/cookie-policy">cookie policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>3. Why we use it and our legal basis</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>To respond to your request</strong> — based on your consent and our legitimate interest in answering enquiries.</li>
    <li><strong>To provide our services</strong> — where we enter into an agreement with you.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics (only with consent)</strong> — to improve the website. <code>[TODO: confirm which analytics, if any, are used]</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>We only share data with service providers that help us run the site and our business:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Our form and hosting provider <code>[TODO: name — e.g. Netlify or Formspree]</code></li>
    <li>Our email provider <code>[TODO: name]</code></li>
    <li><code>[TODO: any other processors — analytics, CRM, scheduling]</code></li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal data.</p>

  <h2>5. How long we keep it</h2>
  <p><code>[TODO: define retention periods — e.g. enquiry data kept for X months, client data for the duration of the engagement plus the legally required period.]</code></p>

  <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
  <p>Under the GDPR / AVG you have the right to access, correct, delete, restrict or object to our use of your data, and to data portability. To exercise these rights, contact us at {contactEmail}.</p>
  <p>You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Dutch Data Protection Authority (Autoriteit Persoonsgegevens) at autoriteitpersoonsgegevens.nl.</p>

  <h2>7. Security</h2>
  <p>We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your data. <code>[TODO: describe measures if required.]</code></p>

  <h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. The date at the top shows the latest version.</p>
</LegalLayout>
